          "success": {
            "en": "“शोचति,” you say, and the little spirit's first drawer slides open. Out comes a neat slip, labelled भवति, नयति, जयति, शोचति, all in one tidy row. He fits it back, delighted. “One drawer,” he says, “and it shuts.”",
